  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><h3>• About Our Brand and Products:</h3><p>The Belfaire is built around statement pieces that don’t blend in. We focus on bold, design-driven accessories and lifestyle products that instantly elevate how someone looks and feels. Every item is selected for its visual impact, uniqueness, and ability to stand out in a crowded space.</p><hr><h3>• What Makes Us Different:</h3><p>We don’t sell basics.<br>Our products are chosen for their “stop scrolling” effect — pieces that spark attention, start conversations, and feel different the moment you see them.</p><p>We prioritize:</p><ul><li>Distinctive design over generic trends</li><li>Strong visual appeal that converts on sight</li><li>Products people <em>want to show off</em>, not just use</li></ul><p>This makes our brand naturally high-performing for content-driven promotion.</p><hr><h3>• How Affiliates Can Earn:</h3><p>Affiliates earn a commission on every sale generated through their unique link or code.</p><ul><li>Competitive commission rates</li><li>High-converting products with strong impulse appeal</li><li>Consistent product drops to keep content fresh</li><li>Exclusive discounts to help drive conversions</li></ul><p>The more you promote, the more you scale — no cap.</p><hr><h3>• How to Promote Us:</h3><p>The Belfaire performs best through visual, content-first platforms.</p><p>Top-performing methods:</p><ul><li>Short-form video (TikTok, Reels)</li><li>Aesthetic product showcases</li><li>“Outfit + accessory” integrations</li><li>Reaction-style or POV content</li><li>Before/after styling transformations</li></ul><p>Focus on the product <em>in action</em> — how it looks, how it changes the vibe, and why it stands out.</p><hr><h3>• Other Information:</h3><ul><li>Fast onboarding — get started immediately</li><li>Dedicated support for affiliates</li><li>Access to new releases before launch</li><li>Opportunity to scale into long-term partnerships</li></ul><p>We’re building a network of creators who understand one thing:<br>attention is earned visually — and our products are built for it.</p></div></div>",
